## Repository guardrails

- Use only main and work. main is the stable/default branch; work is the active integration branch. Recheck both heads and worktree state before any write. Do not merge, release, tag, or publish without explicit authorization.
- Read Agents.rst before Agy-specific work. It distinguishes the local Agy wrapper from a remote coding assistant and defines local binary delivery.
- Production binaries are built by GitHub Actions. Agy running locally must download the requested successful build to the user's local test/ directory and verify it. A remote assistant must not claim its own download was delivered to the user's machine.
